<main data-writer-document>
<header class="title-block">
<h1 class="title">Footnotes and repeated references</h1>
</header>
<p>A named note<sup class="footnote-ref"><a id="fnref-1" href="#fn-1" role="doc-noteref">1</a></sup>, the same note again<sup class="footnote-ref"><a id="fnref-1-2" href="#fn-1" role="doc-noteref">1</a></sup>, and an inline note<sup class="footnote-ref"><a id="fnref-3" href="#fn-3" role="doc-noteref">3</a></sup>.</p>
<section class="footnotes" role="doc-endnotes">
<hr>
<ol>
<li id="fn-1">
<p>The first paragraph of a named note refers to another note<sup class="footnote-ref"><a id="fnref-2" href="#fn-2" role="doc-noteref">2</a></sup>.</p>
<p>A second paragraph in the same note. <a class="footnote-back" href="#fnref-1" role="doc-backlink">↩︎</a> <a class="footnote-back" href="#fnref-1-2" role="doc-backlink">↩︎<sup>2</sup></a></p>
</li>
<li id="fn-2">
<p>A nested footnote reference&#39;s content. <a class="footnote-back" href="#fnref-2" role="doc-backlink">↩︎</a></p>
</li>
<li id="fn-3">
<p>Inline content. <a class="footnote-back" href="#fnref-3" role="doc-backlink">↩︎</a></p>
</li>
</ol>
</section>
</main>
